
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ROTATE: number = 32`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer ROTATE = 32;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant ROTATE has the value 0x20</p>
  <p>Causes a texture animation to change the texture's rotation. Cannot be combined with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/SCALE" target="_blank">SCALE</a>.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
